6–27 fees and separate ER.GO financial-aid tasks.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/programme-research-editorial.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-05\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-13\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/university-of-bologna-admissions-scholarships/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is Bologna's admission deadline?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The exact programme call determines the deadline and applicant category. There is no single date valid for every degree.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is Bologna tuition only €157.04?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"That is the published fixed component for 2026–2027. A variable programme contribution can also apply unless the relevant exemption is granted.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does a fee exemption include an ER.GO scholarship?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Not automatically. Scholarships, accommodation and fee support have distinct conditions and application tasks.\"}}]}"}}]],["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero inner-hero--compact inner-hero--guide inner-hero--visual","children":"$L17"}],"$L18","$L19"]}]
